"type": "text"}], "selected": 0}]}]}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le11ob10re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn7le11ob10re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn7le11ob10re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "Dear Mom,<br/><br/>\nI've been wanting to write to you for a while now, but I've been so busy with life and work lately! Actually, work hasn't really kept me busy in the past couple of weeks.    My sentimental life has been giving me a headache, though!", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn7le11ob10re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "I joined an online dating site called Tender. Sally thought it was something that I could use to try to meet new people. True enough, I've met several girls online who thought that our conversations were amusing. I was so excited to know that they were entertained by the things that I was writing. Sally always says that laughter is the thing which gets people most comfortable on a first date. So I thought that was a good sign ...", "time": "15000"}, {"image": "engenn7le11ob10re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "So far, my first dates have been  disasters! The first bar that we went to was too loud, and I could barely hear what my date was saying. It felt like a very awkward and tiring evening. By the time I came home I was knackered, as Vanessa says.<br/><br/>\nSomething might have changed since last week. I have been talking to this girl since Monday, and we have so many things in common! I just hope she's not out of my league ...<br/><br/>\nLove,<br/><br/>\nPeter", "time": "42000"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le11ob10re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}]}